#: uMain.pas rsBStep555Low
msgid "Ausgang Low (Entladen über R2): t_L = ln 2 · R2 · C = 0,693 × %s × %s = **%s**"
msgstr "Output Low (discharging via R2): t_L = ln 2 · R2 · C = 0.693 × %s × %s = **%s**"

#: uMain.pas rsBStep555Rev1
msgid "Aus f und C: R1 + 2 · R2 = 1 / (ln 2 · f · C) = 1 / (0,693 × %s × %s) = **%s**"
