msgstr "From t_1 = %s (LED 1) and t_2 = %s (LED 2): R_B_2 = t_1 / (k · C) = %s → **%s**, R_B_1 = t_2 / (k · C) = %s → **%s** (nearest %s values)"

#: uMain.pas rsBStepMultiF
